  bx('pk', "<b>Teacher: UPSC asks 3 things</b> = <b>where, who, roughly when, which came first</b>. Very important Prelims chapter: learn tables T1, T2, T3, T5 as place + who + rough year + order. Founding order: Portugal 1500, EIC 1600, Dutch 1602, Danes 1616, French 1664. First-factory order: Portuguese 1498-1500, Dutch 1605, English 1611, Danish 1620, French 1664/1668. Use first-factory order unless the question says &quot;company founded&quot;; the French are last either way."),
