  bx('bl', "<b>Board:</b> 1492 Columbus reached Central America (Spain went west). Portugal east round CoGH to the <b>East Indies</b> = mid-east, India, China, Indonesia, SE Asia (handout: all lands east of CoGH). Cape named <b>Cape of Good Hope</b> by Portugal's <b>King John II</b> (hope of sea route to India)."),
