  bx('bl', "<b>Teacher add-on:</b> about <b>10 to 15 million</b> enslaved taken from W Africa to the Americas (1650-1860). Map: Brazil 5m, West Indies 4.5m, U.S. 0.5m, Lima + W South America 0.5m, Europe 0.3m, Central America 0.2m. (Breast Ripper = Inquisition torture device.)"),
