  t("<b>Carnatic 1801</b>", "EIC influence since <b>2nd CW 1749-54</b> (kept <b>Md Ali 52-95 Wallajah</b>); tighter after 3rd CW 1756-63; <b>annexed 1801</b>, six years after his death in 1795 (Md Ali 52-95, 1752-1795; Ch 9)", "<b>Carnatic Debts</b>: Nawabs borrowed from private EIC officials at high interest, <b>Jagirs as collateral</b>; officials collected LR directly as interest", "<b>Two justifications (Wellesley 98-05):</b> (1) maladministration (board: <b>'Financial'</b>) (2) secret communication with <b>Tipu 82-99</b> (stressed)", "A Nawab so compromised not worth preserving even as puppet; annexed outright = direct EIC territory, not SA State", w=24),
  sec("TRAVANCORE AND KUNDARA 1809", 'g'),
